ss=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ferwater Island</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Illumine Designs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$3,200</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><i><big>\"Up. Down. Up. Down. Useful for hiding away your vechiles!\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The garage door is a door which can be purchased at <a href=\"/wiki/Illumine_Designs\" title=\"Illumine Designs\">Illumine Designs</a> for $3,200. Once placed it can be resized from 4x4x1 to 50x50x1 studs. It can be toggled open and closed by pressing E. It can also be opened through <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Logic#Input\" title=\"Category:Logic\">logic</a> with an <a href=\"/wiki/Interactor\" title=\"Interactor\">interactor</a>. The logic number 5 and above will open it and every logic input below 5 will close them. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The door has a frame around all sides except the bottom.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/54/GarageDoorLargest.png/revision/latest?cb=20240619181843\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The largest possible garage door\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/54/GarageDoorLargest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20240619181843\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"GarageDoorLargest.png\" data-image-key=\"GarageDoorLargest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:GarageDoorLargest.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The largest possible garage door. </p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/84/GarageDoorSmallest.png/revision/latest?cb=20240619181955\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The smallest possible garage door\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"182\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"GarageDoorSmallest.png\" data-image-key=\"GarageDoorSmallest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/84/GarageDoo